namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIAnimEventSection {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimEventTrack.h#DreamUIAnimEventSection
    src   "One named trigger key on the animation timeline. The name is broadcast through the hosting\nUDreamWidgetAnimationComponent's OnAnimationEvent delegate when playback crosses the key.\n\nThis is DreamUI's stand-in for the engine's event track. The engine track needs a director\nblueprint instance and refuses to fire in an editor world unless the endpoint is CallInEditor;\na plain FName broadcast has neither restriction, survives renames and cooking, and any listener\n(the companion behaviour blueprint above all) can bind to it."
    text  "动画时间轴上的一个具名触发键。当播放经过该键时，其名称会通过承载它的\nUDreamWidgetAnimationComponent（控件动画组件）的OnAnimationEvent委托广播出去。\n\n这是DreamUI对引擎事件轨道的替代实现。引擎轨道需要导演蓝图实例，且在编辑器世界中，\n除非端点为CallInEditor，否则不会触发；而普通的FName广播没有这两种限制，能经受重命名和烘焙，\n任何监听者\n（尤其是上方的配套行为蓝图）都可以绑定到它。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIAnimEventSection:EventChannel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimEventTrack.h#DreamUIAnimEventSection:EventChannel
    src   "Each key's value is the event name to broadcast."
    text  "每个键的值是要广播的事件名称。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIAnimEventTrack {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimEventTrack.h#DreamUIAnimEventTrack
    src   "The timeline row holding UDreamUIAnimEventSection. Lives at the root of the sequence, unbound."
    text  "持有UDreamUIAnimEventSection的时间轴行。位于序列的根级，未绑定。"
    state machine
}
